# JorelTX ON — Presets

This directory contains the official JorelTX ON V5 presets.

## Available presets

Presets will be added here as they are tested and verified.

Each preset should include:

* Its intended use
* Required dependencies
* Visual effects enabled
* Known limitations
* Installation instructions

## Important

Not every visual effect works correctly with every application, GPU, driver, or rendering configuration.

Some effects tested during development produced visual artifacts, including:

* Broken or distorted UI
* Cursor artifacts
* Excessive sharpening
* Image fragmentation
* Other rendering glitches

Only configurations that have been tested and considered suitable for release should be added as official presets.

## Naming convention

Presets should use clear and descriptive names.

Example:

```text
joreltx-on-v5-default.conf
joreltx-on-v5-performance.conf
joreltx-on-v5-quality.conf
```

## Contributing

If you want to submit a new preset, please read the project's `CONTRIBUTING.md` first.
